E AX3013 1013-cast-form-value.ax:16:6-10 partial-application "partial application of `cast`: it takes 2 argument(s) and 0 were supplied" #"`cast` takes 2 argument(s), so it cannot be used as a bare value" !"`as`, `sizeof` and `alignof` require their operands; a bare form has no function value" ?"write the value to convert before the target type - `(as e Int)` - or, for a function value, `(lambda (x) (as x Int))`"
E AX3013 1013-cast-form-value.ax:20:6-12 partial-application "partial application of `sizeof`: it takes 1 argument(s) and 0 were supplied" #"`sizeof` takes 1 argument(s), so it cannot be used as a bare value" !"`as`, `sizeof` and `alignof` require their operands; a bare form has no function value" ?"write the type it measures: `(sizeof Int)`"
